# 行尾归一：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows checkout 转 CRLF 造成全文件假 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 真二进制扩展名不参与换行转换
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.fbx binary
*.blend binary
*.14 binary

# Unity 的 .unity / .asset / .meta 是 YAML 文本，走上面的 LF 归一，不标 binary
